      "en": "When they could not come near to him for the crowd, they removed the roof where he was. When they had broken it up, they let down the mat that the paralytic was lying on.",
      "ko": "무리를 인하여 예수께 데려갈 수 없으므로 그 계신 곳의 지붕을 뜯어 구멍을 내고 중풍병자의 누운 상을 달아내리니",
      "source_text_hash": "a9acf01d78db1b4a497053250038c6f98c29a61e6af215eac7be9e46c0cd0a05",
      "translation_text_hash": "778041b8a4c19b2b8220da8d80ca02e53b2da1c71d87beb2064f68b58c3b2818",
