      "en": "But there were some of the scribes sitting there and reasoning in their hearts,",
      "ko": "어떤 서기관들이 거기 앉아서 마음에 의논하기를",
      "source_text_hash": "abbe220542d6f14dba90df4b32e179d6d1cf164f38f305a56a9131f559e455a9",
      "translation_text_hash": "1364a1c280256f4b30b425fed82cdb6d5e8ee71419b80881a96ab6a0bf73d84e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "어떤 서기관들이 거기 앉아서 마음에 의논하기를"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1364a1c280256f4b30b425fed82cdb6d5e8ee71419b80881a96ab6a0bf73d84e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:MRK:2:7",
      "sequence": 24268,
