      "en": "He went out again by the seaside. All the multitude came to him, and he taught them.",
      "ko": "예수께서 다시 바닷가에 나가시매 무리가 다 나아왔거늘 예수께서 저희를 가르치시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "f22053ba3017fc0c9c661c92a6f7c6af0d10112b73ab484fd539e0a907623f9e",
      "translation_text_hash": "61b80ba6e098f75ee7b0bb234b73d244548b77966bccc0625b8e81cbd01e21b9",
