      "en": "But the days will come when the bridegroom will be taken away from them, and then they will fast in that day.",
      "ko": "그러나 신랑을 빼앗길 날이 이르리니 그 날에는 금식할 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "abbad2c1a4f8d16bf9eca924203545c7cc40ef591e66e65a8ef767b843d99203",
