      "en": "He said to them, “Did you never read what David did when he had need and was hungry—he, and those who were with him?",
      "ko": "예수께서 가라사대 다윗이 자기와 및 함께한 자들이 핍절되어 시장할 때에 한 일을 읽지 못하였느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "3c2a68aba64b26868ea1dcce136e357ee247d859a6b7859a87d19227583ab605",
      "translation_text_hash": "4122aee0db5df9ead6f2c5188bd5d96c0c69dda4a4262366a0cc247aa5df4cb8",
