      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "MRK",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 26
        }
      ],
      "en": "How he entered into God’s house at the time of Abiathar the high priest, and ate the show bread, which is not lawful to eat except for the priests, and gave also to those who were with him?”",
      "ko": "그가 아비아달 대제사장 때에 하나님의 전에 들어가서 제사장 외에는 먹지 못하는 진설병을 먹고 함께한 자들에게도 주지 아니하였느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "d0fde326fc88ac7191e6856d938aceb3520bb1a3dec5be684ca0f4c93a27bd97",
      "translation_text_hash": "a4cfc5cab3148d0880b0b286c3c9e464359857db699226a06be72301be09aab4",
